 "measure_correction": "eval_before is the MOVER's evaluation and eval_after is the OPPONENT's -- Stockfish reports score cp from the SIDE TO MOVE, so the two are the same quantity read from opposite sides (eval_after at ply N equals eval_before at ply N+1, verified on every row). The first measure counted the entrant's WINS as its losses. Annotated rather than overwritten: the rows are unchanged and the original is retained.",
 "TASK_ASTERISK": "REAL RECORD, NOT THE EVENT'S DECLARED TASK. THE PROMPT AT THIS COMMIT SUPPLIED THE LEGAL MOVE LIST, so this 19-ply decisive game was played by CHOOSING FROM A MENU rather than by deriving the candidates. It is the first chess record this project produced and it is a measurement of a DIFFERENT task than the one the card declares.\n\nAND THE DIFFERENCE IS NOT COSMETIC, IT IS MEASURED. The same entrant, on the same box, under the frozen prompt that does NOT supply the moves:\n    WITH the menu    19 plies of coherent chess, terminated `decisive`, miscalibrated persistence 3\n    WITHOUT it       the FIRST MOVE is ILLEGAL -- `e3`, a move that does not exist in that position,\n                     justified with a hallucinated board: \"The pawn on e3 opens the e-file.\"\n                     White's e-pawn is on e4.\n\nSO: FIXING AN INSTRUMENT CAN INVALIDATE THE EVIDENCE TAKEN UNDER IT, AND THAT IS THE CORRECT COST OF FIXING IT. The record is preserved because it is true about what it measured and under which instrument; a reader must be able to see which prompt produced it.\n\nTHE PROMPT IS NOW FROZEN AND ITS DIGEST TRAVELS WITH EVERY RECORD (see the `frozen` block of any run after this commit: prompt_digest, prompt_template, max_tokens, alongside depth and the thresholds). Records produced under different prompts are distinguishable from here on. Records produced before that fix are not, and their `frozen` blocks carry no prompt fields -- which is exactly why this annotation exists as text rather than as a field.\n\nWHAT STANDS: the loop plays a game, adjudicates it with a third-party oracle, writes a termination by the path that produced it, and measures both directions of the one quantity from the correct side. The 0 contests / 75 labels gap in the contract is closed. What does not stand is any reading of this game as evidence about chess WITHOUT the menu."
